SUMMARY:Wildfire and Earthquake Expo at the Fairgrounds
DESCRIPTION:The Sonoma County Wildfire &amp; Earthquake Expo is a free\, family-friendly event designed to help kids and families learn how to stay safe and prepared during emergencies. Taking place at the Sonoma County Event Center at the Fairgrounds\, the Expo features hands-on activities\, interactive exhibits\, and engaging demonstrations led by first responders\, local agencies\, and community organizations. This event makes emergency preparedness fun\, approachable\, and empowering for all ages.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/wildfire-and-earthquake-expo-at-the-fairgrounds/
LOCATION:1450 Bennett Valley Rd, , Santa Rosa, CA, 95404, United States
CATEGORIES:Demonstration,Educational,Family Friendly,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/03/20222042/IMG_0059.jpg
END:VEVENT
