SUMMARY:Budbreak at Benziger Family Winery
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Budbreak at Benziger Family Winery\, a 90-minute immersive tasting for members and guests. Begin with a rosé welcome before a guided vineyard walk featuring two white wines paired with seasonal bites. Along the way\, explore the estate’s biodynamic practices\, from grazing animals to water recycling ponds.    Finish on the terrace with two estate red wines\, a grazing table\, and dessert pairing. Guests are invited to relax\, revisit favorite wines\, place orders\, and connect during this scenic spring pickup party.    This limited-capacity experience takes place Saturday\, May 2\, with arrival times at 12:00 or 2:00 PM.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/budbreak-at-benziger-family-winery/
LOCATION:1883 London Ranch Road, Glen Ellen, CA, 95442, United States
GEO:-122.5418777;38.3605875
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Drink,Food,Food & Wine,Food and Wine Pairing,Wine,Wine Tasting
